## PRACTICE MODES

━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━

**BUILDING DRILLS**
- 90s (left/right)
- Ramp rushes
- Box fighting
- High ground retakes
- Tunnel builds
- Cone jumps
- Staircase to heaven

**EDITING DRILLS**
- Window edits
- Cone edits
- Floor edits
- Wall edits
- Mongraal classics
- Triple edits
- Crosshair placement

**COMBINATION**
- Build + edit combos
- Piece control
- Retake + edit
- Box fight scenarios
- Realistic match sims

