## FEATURES

• **FREE BUILD MODE** – Unlimited mats, no cooldowns
• **DRILL LIBRARY** – 50+ pre-made exercises
• **TIMER SYSTEM** – Track your build/edit speed
• **ACCURACY METER** – Missed edit tracking
• **KEYBIND IMPORT** – Use your Fortnite binds
• **SENSITIVITY MATCH** – Same sens as in-game
• **CROSSHAIR OPTIONS** – Multiple styles
• **REPLAY SYSTEM** – Watch your last attempt
• **PROGRESS CHARTS** – Improvement over time
• **CHALLENGE MODE** – Beat target times
• **NO FORTNITE NEEDED** – Standalone trainer

